WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.870
This is The Vanishing Race, Navaho:
Plate One of Curtis's entire project.

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.570
He took it in 1904
and published it in 1907.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.460
Navajo riders move away
from the camera, into shadow,

4
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.250
under a title that tells you what to feel.

5
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.800
Curtis wrote that he meant
to show the Indians

6
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:22.150
as a race passing into the darkness
of an unknown future.

7
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.550
It is beautiful, haunting,
and fundamentally dishonest.

8
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.880
In fact,

9
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.590
the Navajo Nation's population was growing
in these very years.
